    /*
     * 温度接近的堆叠合并，2026-10-05。
     *
     * 需求：温差不超过"这份物品 10 秒里自己会变化的温度量"的同一种物品允许合并，
     * 合并后取两个温度的平均值（2026-10-06 由"热容 × 10、取较低温度"改为此规则）。
     *
     *   forge.ItemHandlerHelperMixin - 机器、管道、物品处理器那一半的"能不能叠"。
     *   tfc.FoodCapabilityMixin      - 群峦设备自己的合并（拿副本判定，改不到真堆叠）。
     *
     * 原版那一半（物品栏、物品实体、合成栏）挂在已有的 minecraft.ItemStackMixin 上，
     * 三个判定合起来用 first.wildfires.utils.HeatStacking 里的同一条规则；
     * "取平均"的落点在 ItemStack#grow 与 FoodCapability#mergeItemStacks。
     * 两边都必须放宽，否则热锭在箱子里叠不起来、在机器里却叠得起来。
     */
    "forge.ItemHandlerHelperMixin",
    "tfc.FoodCapabilityMixin",
    /*
     * Vintage Improvements curving press guard, added 2026-10-05.
     *
     * canCurve walks the recipe's ingredients and, in modes 1 and 2, reads getItems()[0] of the slot
     * it pre-checked without checking the length of that array. An ingredient that is not empty while
     * its item list resolved to nothing - a TFC trait, food or heat filter over a tag whose items
     * carry none of that data - therefore throws ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException out of a predicate.
     * JEI walks every crafting recipe through that predicate inside one plugin callback and abandons
     * the whole callback when it throws, which is why the turning and laser-cutting categories come
     * up empty for the session while the press itself keeps working.
     *
     *   vintageimprovements.CurvingPressGuardMixin - refuses the recipe, with the false that canCurve
     *       already answers for every recipe it cannot process, and names it once in the log so the
     *       pack can fix the ingredient. The rule and the log budget live in
     *       first.wildfires.compat.vintageimprovements and are covered by CurvingPressRulesSelfTest.
     *
     * Like the network guards below it is @Pseudo, names its target as a string and uses remap = false,
     * so the mod is not a compile dependency, no target type appears in a handler signature and the
     * guard is skipped when the mod is absent; require = 1 makes a renamed method fail loudly at
     * start-up.
     */
    "vintageimprovements.CurvingPressGuardMixin",
    /*
     * Simply Tents cellar preservation guard, added 2026-10-07.
     *
     * A tent packs the blocks inside it by copying each block entity's saved data into the tent item and
     * only then removing the block, so the removal hooks that TFC Modern Life takes its temporary cellar
     * preservation off with (the block's onRemove, the drop path, the slot and capability callbacks) find
     * nothing left to clean. A container that stood in a Modern Life cellar therefore travels with
     * tfc_modern_life:cellar_Nx already written onto its food, and food that never stood in a cellar
     * afterwards keeps the doubled shelf life that trait is worth.
     *
     *   simplytents.TentCellarPreservationMixin - puts the cleanup back where the tent restores a container,
     *       which is one call per restored block entity rather than the two the packing side would need
     *       pinned by ordinal, and which also cleans tents packed before this guard existed. It calls
     *       Modern Life's own public strip through first.wildfires.compat.simplytents.
     *
     * Like the guards around it, it is @Pseudo, names its target as a string, uses remap = false and
     * carries require = 1. TFC Modern Life itself is optional for it: the strip is looked up by name and
     * does nothing when that mod is absent.
     */
    "simplytents.TentCellarPreservationMixin",
    /*
     * Outbound network guards, added 2026-10-04.
     *
     * These cut the start-up "phone home" requests of mods that expose no config
     * switch for them. The mods that do have a switch are turned off in config/
     * instead (Xaero, Distant Horizons, ModernUI telemetry, Oculus, IE news...).
     *
     * Every guard is @Pseudo and names its target class as a string with remap = false, so no mod
     * is a compile dependency, no target type appears in a handler signature and the guard is
     * skipped when its mod is not installed at all. That is why they can share this one config and
     * why they are safe to load on either side. Each one also carries require = 1: if an installed
     * mod update renames the guarded method, the guard fails loudly at start-up instead of quietly
     * letting the request through again.
     *
     *   network.AdAstraStationsMixin                   - radio station list
     *   network.AlexsCavesConflictsMixin               - mod conflict list (keeps bundled copy)
     *   network.CitadelPatreonMixin                    - patreon list (keeps bundled copy)
     *   network.ExposureSupportersMixin                - supporter badge list
     *   network.FancyToastsCreditsMixin                - online credit list
     *   network.ImmersiveEngineeringContributorsMixin  - contributor revolver skins
     *   network.KiwiContributorsMixin                  - contributor tiers
     *   network.KubeJsUpdateMixin                      - version check
     *   network.PlaceboTrailsMixin                     - patreon trail list
     *   network.PlaceboWingsMixin                      - patreon wing list
     *   network.SteamRailsDevCapeMixin                 - developer cape list
     *   network.SupplementariesCreditsMixin            - remote credits document
     */
    "network.AdAstraStationsMixin",
    "network.AlexsCavesConflictsMixin",
    "network.CitadelPatreonMixin",
    "network.ExposureSupportersMixin",
    "network.FancyToastsCreditsMixin",
    "network.ImmersiveEngineeringContributorsMixin",
    "network.KiwiContributorsMixin",
    "network.KubeJsUpdateMixin",
    "network.PlaceboTrailsMixin",
    "network.PlaceboWingsMixin",
    "network.SteamRailsDevCapeMixin",
    "network.SupplementariesCreditsMixin",
    /*
     * Channel Casting 管道输入封锁，2026-10-18。
     *
     * 需求：mold_table（模具台）本应只由本模组的铸道（channel）供液，因为铸道会把坩埚
     * 的温度随金属一起传进模具。而它同时在五个面暴露了一个普通 IFluidHandler，其 fill()
     * 完全不看温度——任何模组的管道只要调 fill()，就能把冷金属灌进模具并瞬间铸出锭，
     * 绕过铸道和温度要求。
     *
     *   tfccc.MoldBlockInventoryMixin - 让 fill() 一律返回 0。铸道不走这个方法
     *       （它用 setSource + serverTick 自己 drain 坩埚并写入模具物品），所以铸道不受影响。
     *
     * 该 mixin 带 @Pseudo，并由 NetworkGuardTargets 绑定到 mod id tfcchannelcasting：
     * 未安装该模组时整条 mixin 被丢弃，不会出现“找不到 target”的告警。
     */
    "tfccc.MoldBlockInventoryMixin"
  ],
